Package: oofile
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Description: Sovereign MIME detector, magic byte identifier, and encoding inspector in pure openOODA.
 Magic-byte based file format, MIME type, and encoding identification without exec.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 deep signature identification, POSIX brief/mime flags, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
